{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1224404001:1":{"text":"Blanca, is Sinbad here? I searched the square, but I couldn't find him anywhere.","source_cn":"村长，辛巴达来了吗？我们在广场上找了一圈都没看到他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA81199AD6BB74367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224404002:1":{"text":"This is strange... He was just around here a moment ago.","source_cn":"怪了……他刚才还在附近的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49045DA84D1AEF94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224404003:1":{"text":"Could he have gone off with some Whispers? As far as I know, he's pretty well-connected...","source_cn":"是不是被血薇帮的人叫走了？我记得他认识不少人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E66FEF6063C94F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224404004:1":{"text":"Actually, that kid's just hiding out somewhere.","source_cn":"没那回事，是那臭小子自己躲起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC328CE5CC330C31D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224404005:1":{"text":"Eh? Why?","source_cn":"哎？他为什么要躲起来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1E1872E92D193B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224404006:1":{"text":"Well, he must be too chicken to face what's coming!","source_cn":"还能为什么，不敢面对接下来要发生的事呗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B23B7549E9447A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1224404006":{"text":"Well, he must be too chicken to face what's coming!","source_cn":"还能为什么，不敢面对接下来要发生的事呗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B23B7549E9447A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224404007:0":{"text":"It's not about the trial, but I don't know much either since he didn't tell us a word... After all, he's still young and probably hasn't seen a real trial before.","source_cn":"不是因为审判，其实我也说不清是因为什么……他也不愿意告...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFCE7F62CFEC309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224404008:0":{"text":"You can go in that direction. He should be around the <style=\"highlight\">costume shop</style>.","source_cn":"行了，你们往那个方向去找吧。他应该就在<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A669C85C9645FC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Do you mean Tesio's trial?